About WPP Media

WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships - all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open - we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. 

WPP Media is WPP's AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.

For more information, visit wppmedia.com .

WPP Media - Expression of Interest: Growth Roles &nbsp;

Important Note: &nbsp;
This is not an active job opening. By submitting your details, you are expressing interest in future opportunities at WPP Media. We encourage you to connect with our recruitment team so we can keep you in mind as media changes and new roles emerge. &nbsp;

Discover Your Future in Growth at WPP Media &nbsp;

At WPP Media, our Growth team sits at the heart of how we win, retain , and expand client partnerships. Bringing together strategic thinking, storytelling, commercial acumen, and cross-functional collaboration, Growth plays a critical role in shaping the future of our business and our clients' success. &nbsp;

By registering your interest, you'll : &nbsp;

• Connect with our recruitment team and stay updated on new opportunities. &nbsp;

• Be among the first to hear about relevant openings as they arise. &nbsp;

• Become part of our global collective that's reimagining media. &nbsp;

Responsibilities in Growth roles may include: &nbsp;

• Lead and support the end-to-end pitch process across new client acquisitions and retentions, from opportunity vetting and brief interpretation through final delivery.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Develop tailored, differentiated, and insight-led pitch narratives that address client needs, market context, and competitive dynamics.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Coordinate cross-functional pitch teams, establish workstreams and owners, manage timelines, and keep deliverables progressing against deadlines.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Research clients, categories, consumers, competitors, and decision-makers to create backgrounders and surface relevant opportunity insights.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Develop and quality-control written responses, presentations, credentials, case studies, team bios, creative assets, and pitch theater.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Bring together WPP Media and broader WPP capabilities to create integrated solutions that go beyond the brief and deliver measurable business impact.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Build and nurture prospective client relationships before, during, and after pitches, supporting a strong pipeline of high-value opportunities. &nbsp;

• Capture pitch learnings, maintain best-in-class content and resources, and help improve repeatable processes, tools, reporting, and ways of working.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Manage multiple priorities while maintaining high standards of quality, collaboration, accountability, and the overall pitch experience.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Mentor and support colleagues, sharing feedback and helping build a high-performance Growth culture.&nbsp; &nbsp;

Skills &amp; Experience &nbsp;

We're looking for brilliant people who bring some or all of the following: &nbsp;

• Experience in growth, new business, business development, pitch management, client leadership, marketing, media, strategy, or related fields.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Experience supporting or leading RFI/RFP responses, pitch presentations, retentions, or new client acquisition work.&nbsp; &nbsp;

• Strong storytelling, writing, editing, presentation, and quality-control skills, with the ability to shape compelling client-facing narratives.&nbsp; &nbsp;

